   "source": [
    "The most common user actions on MyCoke 360 are general browsing events such as page_view (33%) and button_click (18%), followed by view_item_list (15%). Engagement drops sharply for transactional events like add_to_cart and proceed_to_checkout. This proves that many visitors explore products but fewer progress to purchase steps."
   ]
